# 05 — AI Resume Analyzer

## Overview

Develop an AI-powered system that analyzes resumes against job descriptions and identifies relevant skills, missing skills, and potential improvements.

## Core Features

* Resume upload
* Resume text extraction
* Job description input
* Skill identification
* Resume-job matching
* Missing skill identification
* Improvement suggestions

## Possible Extensions

* Resume scoring
* Job recommendation
* Skill-gap analysis
* Multiple resume comparison
* Personalized career recommendations

## Suggested Difficulty

Advanced
